nodes.body:
@JustinTong0323 Following up on my September 27 request: could you help route this synthetic audio benchmark PR to the appropriate reviewer and recommend a supported model/setup for a real smoke test?

The PR records 68 passing CPU tests covering WAV generation, streaming/non-streaming requests, warmup failures, and saved-result accounting. A real audio-model smoke test is still outstanding, so these results do not establish model compatibility.

The displayed Base CI failure came from the earlier draft gate. The branch needs updating for #21065's minimum base before fresh CI, and `run-ci` is still missing. Review guidance and help enabling the relevant checks after the branch update would be appreciated. Thanks!

